  "inShort": "The references show preparation, but the playable-slice goal is at risk. No playable build or five-player test results were shown, so progress on tides and co-op remains unverified. Both members confirmed work; Mia's arrival adds programming support for the slice, but her available hours remain unknown.",
  "discussed": [
