  "notDiscussed": [
    "cmvtk5cx1087enxz8u5txutxh"
  ],
  "outsidePlan": [
    "The sprint devlog reports tides on one island and two-player boat crewing. Its mountain photograph does not demonstrate either mechanic. The linked film's title and thumbnail identify Big Buck Bunny, not gameplay. The post documents the claims, but does not verify a playable slice."
  ],
  "questions": [
    "Does an accessible build demonstrate the tide loop, two islands and co-op sailing?",
    "Have five players tested it, and what did those tests reveal?",
    "How many hours can Mia commit during the remaining three weeks?"
  ]
}

